      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Children of Atom are used to living in some of the most radioactive parts of the wasteland, and often seem to suffer little to no effect from the radiation. Whether this is luck, genetic disposition or truly proof of Atom&rsquo;s existence, they gain +2 to their Radiation DR.</span></p>",
